  {
   "id": "fear-the-spotlight-199130@major-2023-04-06",
   "gameId": "fear-the-spotlight-199130",
   "displayName": "Development Update: We're still Stirring in Sunnyside High",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-04-06T19:00:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Welcome back, fans of Fear the Spotlight. It's been a year since you experienced the terror of Sunnyside High, and we've been lurking in the shadows, tirelessly working on bringing you an even more terrifying experience. We can't wait to share some improvements you will see in the full game:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⦁ Physical Puzzles: We've taken inspiration from escape rooms to make the puzzles and exploration more immersive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⦁ An Intelligent Presence: The enemy has become more than just a predictable obstacle. We've upgraded its mind to keep you on edge and constantly guessing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⦁ Heart-pounding moments: We've added much needed scary encounters that are not just puzzles or sneaking. These are moments that will test the limits of your courage",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⦁ More areas to uncover: We've opened up new areas of the school for you to explore, each with its own puzzles and stories to discover.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more updates as we approach the final stages of development. The secrets of Sunnyside High are waiting to be uncovered, but are you brave enough to face them?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
